1
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:54,680
-To start your own company.
But Anton Tyulenev thought differently.

2
00:06:54,760 --> 00:07:00,600
He didn't listen.
Instead he stood at a whiteboard-

3
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:06,200
-And showed what he had been thinking about.
"What are you thinking about this?"

4
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:13,960
He triggered me so I started sketching on how to do it.

5
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:19,200
So he looked at me: "You can't stop."

6
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:25,080
Then followed a couple of months of persuasion on his part.

7
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:31,760
"Shit in everything that has been and everyone else," he told me.
"We're doing this."

8
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:37,400
"You and I do this. We are two of the most competent in our respective areas"-

9
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:41,400
-"Who the hell can beat us? We're doing this."

10
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:46,160
It had been in 2015 before the company Aveiono founded-

11
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:49,560
-A Lars Kristensson and Anton Tyulenev in Malmö.
